# Scripts copied into the image must keep LF. Checked out with CRLF — which is
# what git does on Windows when core.autocrlf=true and nothing says otherwise —
# the shebang becomes "#!/usr/bin/env bash\r" and the container fails to start
# with "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M".
#
# Scoped to this directory so it does not collide with a repository-wide
# attributes file.
*.sh          text eol=lf
Dockerfile    text eol=lf
Dockerfile.*  text eol=lf
*.def         text eol=lf
*.yml         text eol=lf
